      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i'm tired of the \"on one hand, on the other hand\" stuff. it's exhausting and feels like you're dodging the question. i want you to drop the neutrality and be honest. in competitive sports, is it actually fairer to prioritize biological sex or gender identity? just pick a side and tell me why.",
